<title>FRANCE: EU approves maize import quota for Spain, Portugal.</title>
<headline>EU approves maize import quota for Spain, Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union approved Thursday an import quota at a reduced levy of 500,000 tonnes of maize for Spain and of 180,000 tonnes of maize for Portugal, said French national cereals office ONIC.</p>
<p>The measures are part of a series of commercial concessions approved by GATT.</p>
<p>Maize imports come mainly from the United States.</p>
<p>Spain has already imported so far this year under this programme 850,000 tonnes of maize and 150,000 of sorghum.</p>
<p>Portugal has already imported 350,000 tonnes of maize.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
